    <decisions>
        <description>The get funding element before this will only find funding records related to the deal that have not been ruled out or approved yet. If there are records returned in that query, that means the deal should not be auto-declined. If there are no funding records found, that means all lenders have either declined, approved, or are not eligible to fund the deal (meaning the deal should be auto-declined)</description>
        <name>Are_there_any_eligible_lenders_left</name>
